### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@weddingId = aaaaaaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaa-aaaaaaaaaaaa

# IDs de los eventos del seed
@ceremonyId   = e1111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111101
@cocktailId   = e2222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222202
@banquetId    = e3333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333303
@partyId      = e4444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444404

# IDs de las opciones de menú del seed
@menuStdId    = a1111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111101
@menuVegId    = a2222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222202

# Sustituir tras el paso CREATE
@newEventId   = 6510054d-18c4-4c91-b1d6-645b3f8ded9
@newMenuOptId = <pega-el-id-aqui>


### ============================================================
### EVENTS
### ============================================================

### 1. Listar todos los eventos (con sus opciones de menú)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/events

###

### 2. Detalle de la Ceremonia Civil
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/events/{{ceremonyId}}

###

### 3. Detalle del Banquete (debe incluir 4 opciones de menú)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/events/{{banquetId}}

###

### 4. Crear un nuevo evento (Brunch del día siguiente)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weddingId": "{{weddingId}}",
  "name": "Brunch post-boda",
  "eventType": "OTHER",
  "description": "Brunch informal el día siguiente para los más íntimos.",
  "startDatetime": "2026-06-22T11:00:00+02:00",
  "endDatetime": "2026-06-22T14:00:00+02:00",
  "venueName": "Finca El Robledal",
  "address": "Carretera de Brunete, km 12, Madrid",
  "latitude": 40.371200,
  "longitude": -3.894500,
  "displayOrder": 5,
  "isPublic": false
}

###

### 5. Actualizar el evento recién creado (sustituye @newEventId)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/events/76d7e7a9-7510-451d-99d3-ba44e992284e
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weddingId": "{{weddingId}}",
  "name": "Brunch post-boda (actualizado)",
  "eventType": "OTHER",
  "description": "Actualizado: desayuno informal para familia directa.",
  "startDatetime": "2026-06-22T10:30:00+02:00",
  "endDatetime": "2026-06-22T13:00:00+02:00",
  "venueName": "Finca El Robledal",
  "address": "Carretera de Brunete, km 12, Madrid",
  "displayOrder": 5,
  "isPublic": false
}

###

### 6. Borrar el evento de prueba
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/events/76d7e7a9-7510-451d-99d3-ba44e992284e

###


### ============================================================
### MENU OPTIONS
### ============================================================

### 7. Listar opciones de menú del Banquete (deben ser 4)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/events/{{banquetId}}/menu-options

###

### 8. Añadir una opción de menú al Banquete
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/events/{{banquetId}}/menu-options
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Menú Sin Gluten",
  "description": "Alternativa sin gluten para celíacos.",
  "dietType": "OTHER",
  "displayOrder": 5
}

###

### 9. Actualizar la opción recién creada (sustituye @newMenuOptId)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/events/{{banquetId}}/menu-options/902ff5d6-2d77-4f96-a394-546eadc7fdde
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Menú Sin Gluten (revisado)",
  "description": "Apto para celíacos e intolerantes al gluten.",
  "dietType": "OTHER",
  "displayOrder": 5
}

###

### 10. Borrar la opción de menú de prueba
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/events/{{banquetId}}/menu-options/902ff5d6-2d77-4f96-a394-546eadc7fdde
###


### ============================================================
### CASOS DE ERROR
### ============================================================

### 11. 404 - Evento que no existe
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

###

### 12. 400 - UUID mal formado en la ruta
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/events/no-es-un-uuid

###

### 13. 400 - Bean Validation: name vacío y eventType inválido
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "weddingId": "{{weddingId}}",
  "name": "",
  "eventType": "TIPO_INVALIDO",
  "startDatetime": "2026-06-21T12:00:00+02:00"
}

###

### 14. 400 - Añadir menú a un evento que no existe
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/events/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/menu-options
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Menú fantasma"
}
